<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI 工程与职业速报</title><link>https://minhmuot7cu0niw-sudo.github.io/ai-engineering-career-digest</link><description>AI 工程学习与职业判断速报</description><item><title>Release v0.26.7</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.26.7</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.26.7</guid><description>&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;See the complete change list below.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;No known breaking changes.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;Complete Change List&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Adds an operator-scoped model.catalogRefresh setting and lets privacy.usageStatisticsEnabled: false stop background catalog refreshes while local metadata remains available. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16066&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16066/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16066&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;feat(managed-agent): support full model configuration at session creation (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16153&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16153/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16153&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/doudouOUC/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/doudouOUC&quot;&gt;@doudouOUC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;When experimental.unifiedAgentLoop is enabled, ACP Goal turns run on the shared agent loop with shared rounds, tool batches, and stop points. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16131&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16131/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16131&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/qqqys/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/qqqys&quot;&gt;@qqqys&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Adds a Channel events page to Web Shell with a filterable, auto-refreshing timeline of Channel activity, skip reasons, replies, task transitions, and poll results. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16106&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16106/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16106&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/wenshao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/wenshao&quot;&gt;@wenshao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Adds a local /verify-pr Docker recipe that runs untrusted PR code in a container while keeping model credentials on the host through a chat-completion proxy. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16077&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16077/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16077&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/wenshao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/wenshao&quot;&gt;@wenshao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Runs Mods prompt.submit hooks in the Ink terminal before typed prompts are processed, allowing hooks to see composer text with pasted content expanded. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16180&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16180/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16180&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/qqqys/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/qqqys&quot;&gt;@qqqys&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Adds a managed Web Shell host entry, improves managed empty-state layout, and consolidates session-failure and unconfirmed-submission notices above the composer. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15928&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15928/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15928&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Adds Settings → Connections → Allow remote connections to qwen serve, enabling remote access, token use, and client disconnects without restarting. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15887&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15887/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15887&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;With experimental.unifiedAgentLoop enabled, ACP cron and background-notification turns now use the shared agent loop for consistent rounds, tool batching, and stopping. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16190&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16190/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16190&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/qqqys/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/qqqys&quot;&gt;@qqqys&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Workspace uploads can now proceed concurrently while still rejecting occupied destinations and preserving directory occupancy protections. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16212&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16212/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16212&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/doudouOUC/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/doudouOUC&quot;&gt;@doudouOUC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;GitHub events for bound PRs now go to the associated session as untrusted prompts, and replies stay private unless published. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16117&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16117/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16117&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/wenshao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/wenshao&quot;&gt;@wenshao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Web Shell channel editor can now edit GitHub repository access, mention behavior, and notification polling settings instead of requiring manual settings changes. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16149&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16149/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16149&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/wenshao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/wenshao&quot;&gt;@wenshao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Pins the RHEL 10 EPEL bootstrap RPM and makes desktop smoke teardown treat Linux zombie processes as stopped while still reporting live daemon failures. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16154&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16154/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16154&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Compacts live ACP tool-result displays for session replay, so large file edit results show a saved-session preview instead of full old and new contents. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16172&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16172/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16172&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/wenshao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/wenshao&quot;&gt;@wenshao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Fixes PR review endpoint routing by selecting the cohort before the model and reports the final bucket, cohort, model, and endpoint hostname. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16151&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16151/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16151&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;fix(serve): keep record_artifact guidance out of Managed Runtime worker results (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16148&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16148/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16148&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/wenshao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/wenshao&quot;&gt;@wenshao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Binds web-shell config synchronization to the current attachment so config writes made by the first prompt are no longer silently discarded. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16170&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16170/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16170&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/wenshao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/wenshao&quot;&gt;@wenshao&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Fixes tool-choice failures on Claude Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Fable 5.1, and Mythos 5.1 by avoiding unsupported forced tool selection. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15558&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15558/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15558&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Adkid-Zephyr/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Adkid-Zephyr&quot;&gt;@Adkid-Zephyr&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Fixes Web Shell pasting so a single copied image with an HTTP(S) URL attaches the image, while unavailable file pastes show a warning. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16179&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16179/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16179&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/ytahdn/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ytahdn&quot;&gt;@ytahdn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Requires explicit folder trust before repository-supplied hooks, permission grants, and project language servers can run, improving safety for untrusted projects. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16182&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16182/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16182&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Anthropic-compatible requests now honor the configured transport timeout and dispatcher, preventing premature request aborts when a longer API timeout is set. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16193&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16193/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16193&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Remote-access error handling now hides internal error details from callers and fixes several reviewed reliability and security defects. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16199&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16199/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16199&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;On touch devices, navigation now keeps focus on the chat pane instead of opening the composer keyboard, while desktop focus behavior remains unchanged. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16198&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16198/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16198&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/ytahdn/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ytahdn&quot;&gt;@ytahdn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;The bundled Generated UI MCP server now runs correctly in Node mode when the CLI is launched from an Electron-based IDE companion. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16064&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16064/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16064&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yar3333/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yar3333&quot;&gt;@yar3333&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;ACP bridge operations that finish alongside long-lived session or channel events now clean up their results instead of retaining them. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15347&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/15347/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15347&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Sumire-no-kai/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Sumire-no-kai&quot;&gt;@Sumire-no-kai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ordinary workspace execution, member release, and file rewind no longer take the tenant-wide placement lock, reducing cross-workspace blocking. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16205&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16205/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16205&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/doudouOUC/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/doudouOUC&quot;&gt;@doudouOUC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Embedded-webview bundle guard failures now show a readable assertion naming the forbidden marker instead of crashing on a large diff. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16210&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16210/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16210&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Project hooks in .qwen/settings.json now require explicit folder or workspace trust in interactive sessions and show a warning when withheld. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16196&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16196/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16196&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;OpenRouter IDs with :exacto now keep the base model name, so qwen/qwen3-coder:exacto gets its 262,144-token window instead of 200K. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16165&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16165/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16165&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Shizoqua/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Shizoqua&quot;&gt;@Shizoqua&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Shell permission analysis now treats grep -n and grep --line-number as flags, so grep file reads are still checked. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/14383&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/14383/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14383&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/kabishou11/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kabishou11&quot;&gt;@kabishou11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Monitor and workflow completion notifications are attributed to the registering turn, letting active-turn results reach the next model request sooner. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16177&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16177/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16177&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/yiliang114/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/yiliang114&quot;&gt;@yiliang114&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Makes CI sandbox image builds more reliable on hosts with slow default Debian mirrors by switching to a faster mirror only whe